     _e_1 _r_e_l _e_2
           where _r_e_l is one of <, >, <=, >=, ==, or !=. Return 11
           if the relation holds and 00 otherwise.  The comparison
           is numeric if both _e_1 and _e_2 look like integers, and a
           string comparison otherwise.

     _e_1 + _e_2, _e_1 - _e_2
           Add or subtract; both operands must be integers.

     _e_1 * _e_2, _e_1 / _e_2, _e_1 % _e_2
           Multiply, divide, or take the remainder; both operands
           must be integers.

